@startuml
[*] --> TaskSubmitted
TaskSubmitted --> EvaluatingAvailability : Evaluate availability
EvaluatingAvailability --> CheckingSkillset : Check skillset
CheckingSkillset --> ReviewingPastWork : Review past work
ReviewingPastWork --> AssigningTask : Assign task
AssigningTask --> UpdatingAvailability : Update availability
UpdatingAvailability --> TaskAssigned
TaskAssigned --> [*] : Return to initial state
@enduml
